      class="contact-reveal mt-10 border-b border-white/10 pb-16 md:mt-14 md:pb-24"
    >
      <p
        class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-white/60 uppercase"
      >
        Ready When You Are
      </p>

      <h2
        class="mt-5 max-w-[1200px] font-serif text-[clamp(2.75rem,9vw,9rem)] leading-[0.8] tracking-[-0.055em]"
      >
        Let's create{" "}<span class="text-gold">your moment.</span>
      </h2>

      <div
        class="mt-10 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:items-end lg:gap-20"
      >
        <p
          class="max-w-3xl font-serif text-[clamp(2rem,3.8vw,4rem)] leading-[1] tracking-[-0.035em] text-ivory-muted"
        >
          Planning a wedding,
          looking for a Wedding MC,
          need photography,
          or want to learn MC?
        </p>

        <div>
          <p
            class="max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/60 md:text-base md:leading-8"
          >
            Ceritakan rencanamu, tanggal acara,
            lokasi, kebutuhan layanan, atau pertanyaan
            yang ingin didiskusikan.
          </p>

          <p
            class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl text-gold md:text-3xl"
          >
