          </p>

          <p
            class="mt-3 text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-white/60 uppercase"
          >
            Professional Wedding MC
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p
            class="max-w-5xl font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,5.5vw,6.5rem)] leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.045em]"
